---
// TestimonialsHeader.astro
---

<section>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl flex flex-col items-center">
    
    <!-- Subtitle / Eyebrow -->
    <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#C23B22] uppercase mb-4">
      Testimonials
    </span>

    <!-- Main Heading matching the serif style -->
    <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-normal text-[#1A1A1A] tracking-tight leading-tight">
      Voices of Trust
    </h2>

    <!-- Description Paragraph -->
    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-600 mt-5 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
      We don't just build structures; we curate lifestyles. Hear from the visionaries and families who have chosen to build their legacy with Udbhav Developers.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>